('smartur', 'SmartUR', 'startup', 'Interactive 3D virtual learning for STEM education.', 'SmartUR offers 3D digital content, virtual laboratories, and interactive learning tools designed for K-12 and higher education STEM subjects. The platform enables students to explore complex scientific concepts through augmented reality and interactive simulations. It assists educational institutions in modernizing digital classrooms and improving student engagement.', 'https://smartur.com', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Edtech', 'EdTech / 3D Virtual Labs', 'Series A', '2013', 'Neeraj Jewalkar', 'Indian Angel Network, Ventureast', '$3.0M', 17.42647, 78.49755, '', 'live'),
('rowdy-wear', 'Rowdy Wear', 'startup', 'Youth streetwear brand curated for urban fashion.', 'Rowdy Wear is a direct-to-consumer apparel brand offering contemporary casualwear, street style clothing, and accessories. The brand focuses on youth fashion trends with expressive designs, high-quality fabrics, and limited-edition drops. It leverages digital marketing and community-driven engagement to scale its online storefront across India.', 'https://rowdywear.com', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'D2C & Consumer', 'D2C / Youth Apparel', 'Bootstrapped', '2018', 'Vijay Deverakonda', 'Bootstrapped', 'Bootstrapped', 17.40646, 78.51785, '', 'live'),
('spoors-technology', 'Spoors Technology', 'startup', 'Field force management and workflow automation SaaS.', 'Spoors Technology offers ''EFFORT'', an enterprise field workforce management platform automating task scheduling, location tracking, and mobile data collection. The platform optimizes field service operations, audit workflows, and delivery logistics for mid-to-large enterprises. It helps companies increase operational efficiency and gain real-time visibility into distributed field teams.', 'https://spoors.io', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'SaaS', 'Enterprise SaaS / Field Workforce', 'Series A', '2013', 'Ramakrishna Rama, K. S. N. Raju', 'Ventureast, Angel Investors', '$3.0M', 17.41963, 78.52689, '', 'live'),
('napanta', 'NaPanta', 'startup', 'Digital advisory app for smallholder farmers.', 'NaPanta provides an integrated digital farm management platform offering real-time crop advisory, pest management, weather updates, and market prices to farmers. The app assists farmers in optimizing crop yields, reducing input costs, and accessing reliable market intelligence. It empowers rural agricultural communities with accessible digital tools in regional languages.', 'https://napanta.com', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Agritech', 'AgriTech / Smart Farming SaaS', 'Bootstrapped', '2017', 'Naveen Kumar', 'Bootstrapped', 'Bootstrapped', 17.33642, 78.44189, '', 'live'),
('bionic-yantra', 'Bionic Yantra', 'startup', 'Robotic exoskeleton for medical rehabilitation.', 'Bionic Yantra develops wearable robotic exoskeletons and limb rehabilitation devices for patients recovering from stroke, spinal injuries, or mobility impairments. Its flagship Robotic Exoskeleton Assisted Rehabilitation System (ARMS) enables gait training and physical therapy. The company helps hospitals and rehab centers deliver precise, data-backed mobility restoration therapy.', 'https://bionicyantra.com', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Healthtech', 'MedTech / Robotics Rehab', 'Seed', '2017', 'Vaidyanathan Rajagopalan, Dr. Shivakumar S', 'Birac, Social Alpha, Angel Investors', '$1.5M', 17.41791, 78.44681, '', 'live'),
