('bits-birac-bionest', 'BITS BIRAC BioNEST', 'incubator', 'Autonomous navigation and unmanned vehicle technology hub.', 'This BioNEST facility at BITS Hyderabad supports early-stage healthcare, point-of-care diagnostics, and biomedical hardware startups with cleanroom labs, academic expertise, and seed grants.', 'https://bits-pilani.ac.in/hyderabad', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Incubator', 'BITS Pilani Hyderabad / MedTech', '', '2020', 'BITS Pilani Hyderabad / BIRAC', 'BIRAC, BITS Pilani Corpus', 'Institutional Grant', 17.38088, 78.44689, '', 'live'),
